groovebox-scene 1
# Syn 1 on pad 1 through the panel: MENU + step 3, then OK, down and OK in the sound picker. A tap
# of PADS/KEYS then makes the pads keys that play Syn 1.
# The first two steps serve the start-up on an empty storage, which then opens the project.
step 128
step 256
input 1024 press menu
input 1032 press step-3
input 1040 release step-3
input 1048 release menu
input 1056 press ok
input 1064 release ok
input 1072 press down
input 1080 release down
input 1088 press ok
input 1096 release ok
input 1104 press pads-keys
input 1112 release pads-keys
# The records apply the first two notes later than the steps after their hits: messages 1 and 2
# at 2048 and 2560, after New synth's message 0.
input 1124 pad-hit 0 127
step 1152
applied 1 2048
input 1724 pad-hit 7 64
step 2048
applied 2 2560
step 2560
frame 2560
input 3024 pad-release 7
step 5120
frame 5120
input 5224 pad-release 0
step 9216
end 10624
